		(property "Description" "10k DATA_READY pull-down (moved here from the prototype controlboard). In rev B DATA_READY is C5 GPIO3 (MTDI), which floats during reset (no internal pull, datasheet Table 2-1), so 10k holds it firmly low. With the radio absent the STM32 internal pull-down on PB7 holds the line."
